# The build context is an allowlist: everything is ignored except what the
# image is built from. Local state (node_modules, dist, playwright-report,
# test-results, the .git history and .github workflows, server/.data) and
# secrets (.env, .env.*) therefore never reach the daemon or a layer, and
# neither does any file added to the working tree later.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!index.html
!vite.config.js
!LICENSE
!public
!src
!server
server/.data
